@@ -9233,3 +9233,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE F1 (OFF-ARC EXECUTION-VERIFIER TRANSFER; GAP-CODE-EXEC-DEMOFIT; known-issues MANDATORY 2026-06-11; decentralization) -- run the GAP-4 execution primitive (induce program from demos -> restricted-exec -> demo-fit selection) OFF-ARC on MBPP/EvalPlus, ACCUMULATING to power. The GAP-4 rule-execution verifier is domain-general BY CONSTRUCTION (induce program -> exec -> exact-output-match) but its off-ARC transfer is UNDER-MEASURED: exp4032 found no off-ARC transfer (delta_pp=5.0, CI95 [0.0,12.5] incl 0) at low n; GAP-CODE-EXEC-DEMOFIT is OPEN. Map: visible tests = demos (the induction signal), hidden tests = gold (the held-out target). Two arms: vote@1 (majority candidate) vs demo-fit selection (the candidate whose induced program passes the visible/demo tests). Decentralization: local SOTA GGUF generator (gemma-4-12B-it -- many candidates per task, fast), model-free execution verifier. ACCUMULATE-not-restart (memory powering-run-background-mechanism-fails + known-issues 'powering runs must accumulate'): resume the exp4032/exp4051/exp4063 EvalPlus checkpoint (corpus+model keyed, NOT exp-id keyed) and EXTEND n; report ACCUMULATED-N with a bootstrap CI. Gate: demo-fit selection earns held-out (hidden-test) headroom over vote (the ARC-1 analog: vote 0.4516 -> gated 0.5806). Emit off_arc_demofit_beats_vote BARE bool := (hidden-test demo-fit - vote > 0 AND CI95-excl-0). Execution-grounded => verifier_is_oracle=true (HONEST: the cheap/automatic/decentralized execution layer, NOT the oracle-distinct moat). HARD FLOOR: if accumulated n added < a real increment for this window AND the CI still includes 0, LOG the gap + flag for the 3-consecutive-window auto-retire check. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: off_arc_demofit_beats_vote_accumulated_ci_excludes_zero; results/experiment_4319_off_arc_execution_verifier_transfer_accumulate.json
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE G1 (SOTA-ingestion; mandatory per SOTA-Ingestion Cycle Discipline) -- ingest the SOTA for the .399 bleeding-edge forks (cross-domain selector generalization w/ linear router + generated-data + coherence features, in-generation reward-guided step-stitching vs self-reward SMC, budget-aware cascade-router deployment, cross-game learned-verifier transfer) and MAP the strongest 3-5 methods onto the .400 roadmap conditioned on the .399 outcomes (did the cross-domain moat close? did the in-generation moat close? did the cascade router dominate? did cross-game transfer help?). Use the RELIABLE channel ONLY (scripts/sweep_clusters.py / sweep_semscholar.py + low-concurrency WebSearch/WebFetch) -- /deep-research is BANNED in-loop. Every method MUST carry a real arXiv ID/URL. Update research-studying.md (mark ingested) and emit flagged_for_v400. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: sota_ingestion_v400_mapped; results/experiment_4320_sota_ingestion_v400.json
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE G2 (hygiene; per Missing-Verifier Gap Logging + registry hygiene) -- reconcile the verifier registry + gaps to .399 truth, run the GAP-4 regression guard, and LOG missing-verifier gaps. Record the .399 outcomes: the cross-domain selection verdict (exp4314 cross_domain_selection_holds + label_ablation_robust), the in-generation moat (exp4315 diffusiongemma_guidance_moat + controls_differentiated + carnot_minus_self_reward_smc_delta), the efficiency cascade-router (exp4316 cascade_dominates_controls + cost_ratio_cascade), the ARC +1 (exp4317 total_levels + offline_reproduced), the cross-game transfer (exp4318 cross_game_transfer_helps), the off-ARC execution transfer (exp4319 off_arc_demofit_beats_vote + accumulated_n). Update ops/verifier_registry.yaml + ops/verifier_gaps.md (e.g. update GAP-CROSS-DOMAIN-FAMILY-INVARIANT-SELECTION-4305 per exp4314; a 'game-invariant ARC value representation' gap if exp4318 nulled; GAP-CODE-EXEC-DEMOFIT per exp4319). Run the GAP-4 execution regression guard (no regression vs .398). Use the robust aggregate-available helper from exp4308 (read available artifacts, report gaps -- do NOT hard-block all-False if one is missing). Emit regression_guard_passed BARE bool. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=complete: registry_gaps_manifest_reconciled_to_v399_truth_regression_guard_passed_True_gaps_logged_3_robust_aggregator_used; results/experiment_4321_verifier_registry_gaps_hygiene.json
+- 2026-06-17: PHASE G3 (hardware continuity; opportunistic per north-star §3) -- KV260 terminal/opportunistic (SSH-only reachability + xmutil listapps; NO host SD-card precondition), PolarFire CPU dispatch hash-verify, GateMate USB detect (try `openFPGALoader -c dirtyJtag --detect` to recover the IDCODE visibility lost in .398). KV260 is terminal (north-star §3) so the per-board mandate relaxes to opportunistic; this task keeps the boards visible without blocking the milestone. Report per-board reachability + any opportunistic result. NO board blocks the milestone (honest blocked_<board> per board is fine). (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=complete: hardware_continuity_4322_kv260_kv260_terminal_xmutil_listapps_blocked_returncode_1_polarfire_polarfire_hash_verified_cpu_dispatch_succeeded_gatemate_blocked_gatemate_unreachable_ssh_usb_reachability_only; results/experiment_4322_hardware_continuity.json
